{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go Kill Satan! Test your strategic skill with 4 player classes, each with unique tactical abilities, to explore the depths of the world in search of the last wild Satan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/2741f16232c1ce6f9d1f982e70f351cd.avif?t=1767884521\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player ability contains hidden depths and situational bonuses to build strategies around. For example, the Crusader's Holy Fires ability has its damage multiplied for each target it hits. Some of the beefiest enemies in the game can be taken down easily, just by surrounding yourself with more foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/db4066cfbfc22e9684e89b2a8ff01a25.poster.avif?t=1767884521\" width=619 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/db4066cfbfc22e9684e89b2a8ff01a25.webm?t=1767884521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class offers synergies between different skill trees. A wizard who finds a useful dagger can specialize in melee abilities, while Scoundrel with the Marksman ability can use Quick Step to hold off multiple melee attackers at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/4b3ac86bd65d5f21bdece96493f75417.avif?t=1767884521\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring the dungeons, you are sure to find loot that will give you critical tactical options as you explore. Do you save the energy potion for a clutch heal or retreat? Or do you throw it for massive area of effect damage? Choose wisely! Every decision can make or break a run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/cc54f877971a6955814c18a6bf62e0ec.poster.avif?t=1767884521\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/cc54f877971a6955814c18a6bf62e0ec.webm?t=1767884521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players familiar with the game's original mobile release in 2010 will find new equipment and items, as well. The brand new Dragon Armor offers unparalleled protection for a time, but is one of the rare items in the game with durability. Be ready, though! When it breaks, it breaks hard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/bf3aa68fbd22e9d637a9f64fefc6c302.poster.avif?t=1767884521\" width=616 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/bf3aa68fbd22e9d637a9f64fefc6c302.webm?t=1767884521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/f17a8df48a799439a2df5fd371f7191a.avif?t=1767884521\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/d44987e59308476e52b63455b3c89c36.poster.avif?t=1767884521\" width=616 height=343 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/d44987e59308476e52b63455b3c89c36.webm?t=1767884521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranger areas of the dungeons exist, offering shortcuts, reprieves, secret items and opportunities to slip around the standard downward progression through dungeons. Knowing when to use these secrets to your advantage can make the difference between a successful run and an impossible battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This roguelike adventure features procedural item generation, random dungeon maps, and fully animated pixel art for over 50 unique monsters. Endless challenges and secrets await.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763720?t=1767884521","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/10f828a1ed8a014ce518fa063ad92abb754c91c1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767884521","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/8a087b93d1f14d83fd734b4a1c9f5a57e64301be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767884521","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/8a087b93d1f14d83fd734b4a1c9f5a57e64301be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767884521","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4292870,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go Kill Satan! Test your strategic skill with 4 player classes, each with unique tactical abilities, to explore the depths of the world in search of the last wild Satan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/2741f16232c1ce6f9d1f982e70f351cd.avif?t=1767884521\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player ability contains hidden depths and situational bonuses to build strategies around. For example, the Crusader's Holy Fires ability has its damage multiplied for each target it hits. Some of the beefiest enemies in the game can be taken down easily, just by surrounding yourself with more foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/db4066cfbfc22e9684e89b2a8ff01a25.poster.avif?t=1767884521\" width=619 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/db4066cfbfc22e9684e89b2a8ff01a25.webm?t=1767884521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class offers synergies between different skill trees. A wizard who finds a useful dagger can specialize in melee abilities, while Scoundrel with the Marksman ability can use Quick Step to hold off multiple melee attackers at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/4b3ac86bd65d5f21bdece96493f75417.avif?t=1767884521\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring the dungeons, you are sure to find loot that will give you critical tactical options as you explore. Do you save the energy potion for a clutch heal or retreat? Or do you throw it for massive area of effect damage? Choose wisely! Every decision can make or break a run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/cc54f877971a6955814c18a6bf62e0ec.poster.avif?t=1767884521\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/cc54f877971a6955814c18a6bf62e0ec.webm?t=1767884521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players familiar with the game's original mobile release in 2010 will find new equipment and items, as well. The brand new Dragon Armor offers unparalleled protection for a time, but is one of the rare items in the game with durability. Be ready, though! When it breaks, it breaks hard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/bf3aa68fbd22e9d637a9f64fefc6c302.poster.avif?t=1767884521\" width=616 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/bf3aa68fbd22e9d637a9f64fefc6c302.webm?t=1767884521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/f17a8df48a799439a2df5fd371f7191a.avif?t=1767884521\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/d44987e59308476e52b63455b3c89c36.poster.avif?t=1767884521\" width=616 height=343 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/extras/d44987e59308476e52b63455b3c89c36.webm?t=1767884521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranger areas of the dungeons exist, offering shortcuts, reprieves, secret items and opportunities to slip around the standard downward progression through dungeons. Knowing when to use these secrets to your advantage can make the difference between a successful run and an impossible battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This roguelike adventure features procedural item generation, random dungeon maps, and fully animated pixel art for over 50 unique monsters. Endless challenges and secrets await.</p>","developers":["Keith Burgun","Wes Osborne-Paugh","Blake Reynolds"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763720/e017631691ca16ddc9e76210cf28b5c35f6bd405/header.jpg?t=1767884521","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS Holo 3.7.05<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Zen 2 4c/8t, 2.4-3.5GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 RDNA 2 CUs, 1.6GHz<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 350 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</stron